ring.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Which colours and sizes can I request?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Beige and Camel, with size labels 35-45. Send your colour-size quantities. Current availability and fit measurements are confirmed before order; no unverified US size conversion is provided.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What is the minimum order and price?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>The listed minimum order is 2 pairs. Reference unit prices are USD 17.47 for 2-49 pairs, USD 16.31 for 50-99 pairs and USD 15.14 for 100 pairs or more. Freight, packaging and final order terms are confirmed separately.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>How do I confirm fit for my assortment?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Please share the sizes you need and your fit or measurement requirements. Confirm the agreed size labels and product measurements before ordering. No foot-length chart or wider-fit promise has been verified for this style.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Can I request samples or customization?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Send your sample quantity, logo, colour and packaging requirements. Feasibility, sample charges, minimum quantities and timing are assessed before quotation; customization is not included automatically.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>How are dispatch and delivery arranged?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Send your destination, quantities and required date. Colour-size availability, packaging, freight options and dispatch timing are confirmed before order. The listing does not guarantee current stock or a fixed seven-day dispatch period.</value></field></complex-values></field></itemSchema>